Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.40,0:06:14.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《致命弯道5：嗜血族》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:30.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西维吉尼亚州美湖镇 1814年建镇{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.05,0:00:34.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1817年镇民集体消失无踪{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.07,0:00:38.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至今原因不明{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.06,0:01:26.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你 比利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you,Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.02,0:01:44.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.08,0:01:52.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 比利 我想你打断我的下巴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it,Billy. I think you broke my jaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.07,0:01:55.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是活该 你们这些王八蛋!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fucking deserve it, you assholes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.03,0:01:56.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 宝贝 你没事吧?  - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh,are you okay,baby?  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.09,0:01:58.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快给我滚开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the fuck out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.08,0:02:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们干嘛打扮成那样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing dressed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.01,0:02:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们想打扮一下 庆祝山地人节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the Mountain Man Festival, thought we'd dress up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.08,0:02:05.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 你们的服装在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,where are your costumes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.08,0:02:07.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 我们没有准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What?  - We don't have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.03,0:02:10.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没变装就不能去 那太不认真了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't go without a costume. It shows lack of commitment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.04,0:02:13.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能等我穿好衣服后再谈吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we have this conversation after I can get dressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.05,0:02:15.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:17.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很不错喔 比利...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice,Billy. Ha-ha-ha. Grrr...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.04,0:02:20.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了 王八蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice. Assholes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:26.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是凯琳韦伯 在美湖镇为大家报导...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Kaleen Webber,reporting from the small town of Fairlake...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.03,0:02:29.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每年万圣节在这里会挤满了人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which,once a year, turns into a big town on Halloween...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:32.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庆祝第十届山地人音乐节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}due to the 10th annual Mountain Man Music Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.03,0:02:35.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全国各地的年轻人来到美湖镇...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People from all over the country descend upon Fairlake...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.01,0:02:39.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整个周末享受音乐 派对 到镇外的游乐园玩个痛快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a weekend of music,partying and fun at the fairgrounds just outside town.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.07,0:02:42.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,音乐节规模越来越大 足以媲美对手...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The festival has grown over the years to where it now rivals...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.07,0:02:44.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柯契拉音乐节与洛拉帕洛查音乐节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coachella and Lollapalooza.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:48.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人说自由精神与喧闹群众 让他们想起火人祭...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But some say that its free spirit and rowdy crowds reminds them of Burning Man...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.09,0:02:51.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让当地警方非常担忧今晚的活动状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which has local officials concerned on this night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.08,0:02:54.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在将镜头交还给棚内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now back to you at the studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.06,0:02:56.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 太棒了  - 听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Great.  - Here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.03,0:02:58.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去跑步 忘掉这个乱七八糟的小镇活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going for a run to get my head out of this town crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.01,0:03:01.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十一点我会回到这里做报导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll meet you here for the live feed at 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.05,0:03:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时候最好一切准备都好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And everything better be ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.02,0:03:05.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚开 小鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go away,kid. Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.01,0:03:17.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 我们得上路了 我不想迟到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up. We gotta get on the road. I don't wanna be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:20.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊 给我一分钟时间清醒一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, give me a minute to get up first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.03,0:03:23.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们听说你是一分钟男\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We heard you're the one-minute man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.02,0:03:26.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我可以保证绝对没有那回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I assure you he has no problems in that department.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.09,0:03:29.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我饿坏了 我得先做早餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. I'm starving. I gotta make breakfast first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:33.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 少来了 比利  - 早餐一定要吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aw,come on,Billy.  - You gotta start your day out right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.01,0:03:50.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha,ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.01,0:03:57.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,服装很不错 怪胎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice costume,creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.08,0:04:06.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗? 我厌倦了这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? I'm sick of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:11.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我厌倦了你们这些孩子 只会跑趴 胡闹跟吓人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sick of you kids partying, making a mess and trying to scare people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.07,0:04:13.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗? 你吓不了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,you know what? You don't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.00,0:04:16.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你的 滚回家去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So fuck you. Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.04,0:04:26.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我! 拜托! 快来人啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me! Help me,please! Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.09,0:04:29.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,hey. Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.07,0:04:33.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请帮帮我 他们在追我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,please help. They're chasing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.02,0:04:35.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来 这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me. This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.07,0:04:41.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往下走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.03,0:05:07.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.03,0:05:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我想他们离开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay,I think they've gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.05,0:05:13.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 你从那些疯子手上救了我一命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. You saved me from those maniacs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.05,0:05:16.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你流了很多血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,you're bleeding pretty badly there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.04,0:05:17.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得帮你包紮一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me fix that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.01,0:05:20.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.03,0:05:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 你该谢谢我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Thank God for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.06,0:05:28.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用力压住伤口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,you keep pressure on that. Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.03,0:05:30.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 待在这里别动  - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You stay here.  - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.03,0:05:32.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去确定他们已经离开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna make sure they've gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.03,0:05:40.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好吧 没人了 往这边  - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay,it's all clear. This way.  - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.09,0:05:43.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay,okay,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.07,0:05:46.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there's,uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.01,0:05:50.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我忘记告诉你一件事  - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's just one thing I forgot.  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:52.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.06,0:06:22.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 帮个忙 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,give me a hand,will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.07,0:06:32.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 你这个大白癡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,you fucking idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.02,0:06:35.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是指屍体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的老天爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus fucking Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.08,0:07:07.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这可以让你提提神 兄弟  - 谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wake and bake,brother.  - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:10.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个邋遢鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heh. You're such a slob.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.09,0:07:13.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就当是为了我 拜托你保持乾净一点?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you try and be a little bit cleaner for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.08,0:07:15.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 你看起来跟猪差不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What?  - You look like a pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.01,0:07:17.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我照日期跟时间 安排好所有的派对计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got all our party favors arranged by date and time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:23.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这搞得我头都痛了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this is cutting into my overhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.01,0:07:28.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过为了欢庆这个周末 朱利安建议我们到这里的好点子...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But in honor of this weekend and Julian's great idea for us to come out here...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.02,0:07:29.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我特别破例\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've made an exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.09,0:07:33.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先是你们的一些恶习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First up,some chronic, which you're participating in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.05,0:07:38.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后是限制级的不给糖就捣蛋...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then some X for when we go trick or treating...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.03,0:07:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乐团一开始表演 我们就能茫翻天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and some shrooms for when the bands start playing. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.07,0:07:43.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比利 你已经休学两个学期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been out of school for two semesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.01,0:07:47.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你爸妈是怎么说的?  - 不 他们什么都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do your parents think?  - Oh,no. They don't know shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:49.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望保持原状\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I wanna keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:53.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我是新生代企业家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah,besides,you know, I'm a budding entrepreneur.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.00,0:07:56.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们干嘛跑到这个鸟地方来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did we have to come all the way out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.05,0:08:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们要庆祝山地野人节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it's Mountain Man,baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.00,0:08:03.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样 听着 我们也可以参加火人祭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,come on,look, we could have gone to Burning Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.07,0:08:06.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不想开车横跨美国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm not gonna drive all the way across country.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.08,0:08:08.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里一样能玩得很开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a homegrown version of it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:12.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且山地人节的故事更有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Mountain Man has got a much more interesting story to it,anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.02,0:08:16.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 克鲁丝 你知道这个故事吗?  - 我不是本地人 记得吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know the story,Cruz?  - I'm not from around here,remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:19.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我们要去美湖镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay,well,we're going to a small town called Fairlake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.04,0:08:22.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建镇年代大约是1814年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was founded in 1814 or some shit like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.03,0:08:26.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然当地矿工跟山区居民处不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,apparently,the local miners didn't get along too well with the hill people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.08,0:08:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想他们是在争地盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess it was a territory dispute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.09,0:08:31.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来好几年冲突不断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was conflicts over the next couple of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.03,0:08:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在1817年万圣节夜晚...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,Halloween night,1817...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.07,0:08:39.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山地人突袭全镇...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the entire town was ravaged by hillbillies...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.03,0:08:42.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,酿成美国史上最严重集体屠杀事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the largest massacre in the state's history.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.09,0:08:44.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题是找不到屍体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only problem was no bodies were found.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.00,0:08:48.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只... 发现大量血迹 你懂的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was just... Just blood. Lots of it. It was... You know,it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.02,0:08:52.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全镇的居民都不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The entire town, every inhabitant disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.08,0:08:54.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从此消失无踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was never seen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.01,0:08:58.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那真的很可怕...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's awful. Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.03,0:09:03.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传说山地人把屍体拖进树林里...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Legend has it,the hillbillies hauled all the bodies up to the woods...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.03,0:09:08.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生火把美湖镇民的屍体煮熟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}created a huge bonfire and then they cooked the fair residents of Fairlake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.07,0:09:12.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后吃进肚子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well... And then they ate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.05,0:09:23.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好吧 你们知道吗? 我不想去了  - 别这样 宝贝 我们就快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay,you know what? I don't wanna go.  - Oh,come on,baby,we're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.01,0:09:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我不要庆祝大屠杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I don't wanna celebrate a massacre.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.05,0:09:29.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这只是为了玩乐  - 那是不对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's innocent fun.  - It's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.02,0:09:32.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们今晚过去 明天就离开 好吗?别这样 克鲁丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll just go tonight,we'll leave tomorrow,okay? Come on,Cruz.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.04,0:09:33.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一晚就好?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just one night,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.01,0:09:35.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.00,0:09:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay,fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.08,0:09:42.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:41.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼东西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck is all this shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.06,0:10:44.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是怎么跟你说的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have I told you about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.03,0:10:48.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟你说过太多次...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you a thousand fucking times...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.09,0:10:54.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别留下任何证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you never leave anything behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.02,0:11:00.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千万别留下任何证据!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never ever leave anything behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:03.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果被人发现了呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if somebody found this,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.09,0:11:08.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警察会开始调查 四处打探\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you got oops investigating, snooping around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.05,0:11:12.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不住在偏僻医院里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't live in some goddamn hospital in the middle of nowhere any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.08,0:11:17.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里离文明世界太近了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You live closer to civilization, a lot fucking closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.00,0:11:22.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做这一行三十年了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have been doing this for 30 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.03,0:11:25.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从来不必搬家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I have never had to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.07,0:11:28.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们知道为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.02,0:11:33.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我从来不会留下证据!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I never leave shit behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.05,0:11:37.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对天发誓 你们三个大笨蛋...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear to fucking God, you three pinheads...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.07,0:11:41.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不是遇见我 你们早被关起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'd all be under lock and key by now if I hadn't have happened across you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.09,0:11:52.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们住在我家 就得听我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You live in my fucking house now and you play by my fucking rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:54.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖照我的方式去做...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do as I say...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:59.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然我发誓我会杀了你们 管你们跟我是什么关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or I swear to God, I will take you all down,kin or no kin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.06,0:12:04.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把她处理好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get her processed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.01,0:12:16.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 很期待这趟旅行吗?  - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Looking forward to the trip?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.04,0:12:19.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想像我拿着新步枪的帅模样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thinking about getting me a new .30-60 for the occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.00,0:12:22.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傑森真的很幸运 抽中猎熊执照乐透奖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was lucky of Jason to win the bear license lottery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.06,0:12:24.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 他很兴奋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. He's very excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.06,0:12:28.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他真是个大好人 邀请我同行  - 我知道 所以我决定嫁给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well,he's a good guy to invite me along.  - I know. That's why I married him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.06,0:12:31.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你真的不想去?  - 我还有工作要做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You sure you don't wanna come?  - I've got a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.00,0:12:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得学着放轻松一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to learn to relax a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.09,0:12:37.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总是一付严肃模样 像管理军队一样指挥着我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're always so by-the-book. You ride us like we're in the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.09,0:12:40.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纪律 朱尼尔 它是非常好用的生活工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Discipline,Junior, it's a good tool to use in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.09,0:12:47.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为今晚的活动准备好了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready for tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.08,0:12:51.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一群爱捣蛋的小鬼 超讨厌的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mob of kids,such a pain in the keester.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:54.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚应该少不了 酒醉闹事跟滋扰治安的事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It should be a big night for drunk and disorderly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.01,0:12:58.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡特警长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sheriff Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.03,0:13:01.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁是绿荆郡最性感的警长?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is the sexiest sheriff in all of Greenbrier County?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.05,0:13:04.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是绿荆郡唯一的警长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the only sheriff in Greenbrier County.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.02,0:13:05.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不代表你不性感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still doesn't mean you're not sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.00,0:13:08.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚值完第二班 现在要回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,I just blew off the second shift. I'm headed home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.08,0:13:10.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.01,0:13:13.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱尼尔要买新步枪 这个周末跟你去打猎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Junior's buying a new rifle for your hunt this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.05,0:13:17.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟他说那不代表他会比我厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him it won't make him a better shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.09,0:13:19.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我已经跟他说过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,I already did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.03,0:13:21.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天晚餐我要做千层面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna fix some lasagna tonight for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.06,0:13:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 要我带一些过去给你吗?  - 那就真的太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll stop by and bring you some?  - That would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.02,0:13:27.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来前先打电话联络一下 今晚应该会很忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But call first. It's gonna be a busy night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.03,0:13:29.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可能会到游乐园去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may head down to the fairgrounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.04,0:13:31.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么我帮你把晚餐送到那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'll bring it to you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.03,0:13:32.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待会再联络 再见 老婆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll call you later. Bye,honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:35.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 再见 老公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay,bye,honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:46.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大声一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotta turn this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.07,0:13:48.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该会有二十支乐团到那里表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's supposed to be about 20 bands there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.00,0:13:51.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谁要上台表演?  - 《花豹浪女》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh,who's playing?  - The Cheetah Whores.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.07,0:13:52.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她们是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.01,0:13:55.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 纯女子乐团 她们超棒的  - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- An all-girl band. Freaking awesome.  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:56.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 葛斯最喜欢的乐团  - 噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gus' favorite band.  - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.01,0:13:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果她们真的那么厉害 为什么我没听说过她们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they're so awesome, why haven't I heard of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.06,0:14:01.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来自西岸 她们不在那里表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're from the West Coast. They don't play there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.01,0:14:04.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对了 你何时回去?  - 六月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- When are you gonna go back,by the way?  - Mm,June.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.04,0:14:06.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只待一个月 陪陪我爸妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But just for a month to see my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.04,0:14:08.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 比利要陪我一起去  - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Billy is coming with me.  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.06,0:14:11.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 太棒了  - 我们会玩得很开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nice.  - We are gonna have an epic time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.09,0:14:14.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟爸妈见面? 那还蛮认真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meeting the folks? That's getting pretty serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.04,0:14:17.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁? 我? 认真? 才怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who? Me? Serious? Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.09,0:14:19.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.03,0:14:35.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家没事吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is everyone okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.07,0:14:37.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人受伤吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is anybody hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我没事  - 不 我们都没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm all right.  - No,we're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.00,0:14:48.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.05,0:14:51.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是从哪里冒出来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did he come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.02,0:14:53.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们撞到他了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did We hit him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.01,0:14:55.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.01,0:14:57.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该去看看他是不是死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,we should see if he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.02,0:15:04.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们待在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys,stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.00,0:15:08.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.03,0:15:10.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下着雨 我根本没看到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't see him in the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.02,0:15:21.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对 我想他死了  - 可是我没撞到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah,I think he's dead.  - But I didn't hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:25.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定有撞到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must have.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:27.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.07,0:15:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you! Unn!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.08,0:15:32.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想耍我们吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You trying to fuck with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.04,0:15:34.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 起来  - 你这个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get up.  - You piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.01,0:15:47.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不要动  - 手放在头上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Freeze.  - Put your hands on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.09,0:15:50.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他拿刀砍我  - 手放在头上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He stabbed me.  - Put your hands on your head now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.03,0:15:51.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.00,0:15:55.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 转身 朝我这边走过来  - 该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Turn around and walk towards me.  - Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.02,0:15:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.07,0:15:58.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.01,0:16:02.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要大家在车边等着 毕格斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want everyone to wait together by your vehicle. Biggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.09,0:16:04.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会看着他们 警长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got them,sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.07,0:16:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:12.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趴在地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Face down on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.00,0:16:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,右手放在背后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right hand behind your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.08,0:16:22.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.06,0:16:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.08,0:16:43.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要厢型车支援 96号公路30英里处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a wagon. Route 96,mile marker 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.02,0:16:46.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 收到 马上出发  - 太棒了 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Copy that. On its way.  - Great,thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.01,0:17:01.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.06,0:17:06.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来那些孩子在开药局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks like we've got an entire pharmacy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:08.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,音乐节都还没有开始呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the festival hasn't even started yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.00,0:17:11.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这会是漫长的一夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be a long night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:14.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱尼尔 你能留守在这里 等拖吊车过来吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Junior,can you stay with the car until the tow truck arrives?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.08,0:17:17.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得进行全面搜索 我不希望破坏证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until we get a search? I don't wanna mess up evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.06,0:17:18.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题 警长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure thing,boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.04,0:17:47.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.01,0:17:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.07,0:17:52.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.01,0:17:55.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.00,0:18:44.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(美湖镇警局)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.08,0:18:46.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.07,0:18:52.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那应该可以了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.01,0:18:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三星期后再拆线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to have those stitches removed in about three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.04,0:18:57.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.09,0:19:02.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我弄好了 警长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All done here,sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.05,0:19:24.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你赶过来 瑞克  - 别客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks for coming,Rick.  - That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.00,0:19:28.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道今晚你会有多忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how busy it's gonna get for you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.03,0:19:29.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 再见  - 晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Goodbye.  - Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.08,0:19:36.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know,I just don't know what I'm gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.01,0:19:40.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被起诉的话 奖学金就会被取消\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I get charged,they're gonna take my scholarship away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.02,0:19:43.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们会被退学的  - 比利 你得告诉她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We can get kicked out of school.  - Billy,you gotta tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.04,0:19:46.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是你的毒品 与我们无关  - 不 如果他说那都是他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It was your drugs,not ours.  - No,no. If he claims it's all his...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.06,0:19:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们会逮捕他  - 我不在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- they could throw the book at him.  - I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.07,0:19:51.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他害我被关在拘留所里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sitting in jail because of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.09,0:19:58.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不知道该怎么办  - 好了 别担心 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I just don't know what I'm gonna do.  - All right,hey,don't worry,all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.08,0:20:01.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会处理的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.05,0:20:05.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警长 我们能谈一谈吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sheriff,can I speak with you a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.03,0:20:06.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.06,0:20:09.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毒品是我的 跟我的朋友们无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The drugs are mine. My friends had nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.07,0:20:10.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一点还有待确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's to be determined.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:13.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们真的是我的 他们可以作证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honestly,they're mine. They'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:14.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说的没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.05,0:20:18.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你放了他们 我会负起责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please let them go. I'll take responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.04,0:20:25.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 反正我得为今晚预留牢房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. I'm gonna need space tonight, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.02,0:20:34.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别离镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't leave town.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.06,0:20:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们哪里都不会去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We won't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.07,0:20:39.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,街的尽头有家汽车旅馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a motel at the end of the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.00,0:20:52.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢  - 去领你们的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks.  - Come get your things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.02,0:21:09.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会带晚餐来给你 比利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll bring you back some dinner,Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.05,0:21:11.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:17.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 那我呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.01,0:21:21.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到他们攻击我 为什么我要被关起来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saw how they attacked me. Why am I being held?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.05,0:21:22.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,持致命武器伤人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assault with a deadly weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.09,0:21:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是胡说八道  - 那孩子手臂的伤口证明了一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's bullshit.  - The out on the boy's arm says otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.05,0:21:29.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少你能帮我换间牢房吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,would you at least move me to another cell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.01,0:21:32.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个酒鬼臭死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This drunk stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.06,0:21:33.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能撑过来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.03,0:21:42.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她在哪里?  - 我打了一小时手机找她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is she?  - I've been calling her cell for the last hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.04,0:21:44.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她没接  - 该死的爱现鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's not picking up.  - Freaking diva.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.09,0:21:47.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我讨厌选秀会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.07,0:21:49.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得帮她代打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna have to fill in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.01,0:21:51.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.04,0:21:53.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我没办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.03,0:21:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以的 你非这么做不可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can and you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.00,0:21:58.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝对不准节目开天窗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one goes to dead air on my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.09,0:22:02.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.08,0:22:07.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在西维吉尼亚州美湖镇大街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are on Main Street in the town of Fairlake,West Virginia.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.01,0:22:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子们跑到街上疯狂庆祝万圣节...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The kids are out for Halloween in full force...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.09,0:22:12.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过有一群山地人加入他们...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but they're joined by a bunch of hillbillies...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.06,0:22:15.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起庆祝第十届山地人音乐节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the 10th annual Mountain Man Music Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.03,0:22:19.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不论你打扮成鬼 女巫或山地人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So whether you're dressed as a ghost or a witch or a hillbilly...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.03,0:22:21.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都能欢度万圣节...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everyone is sure to have a happy Halloween...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.07,0:22:24.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,享受一流音乐表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with some great music to top it all off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.05,0:22:26.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是目前的状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.01,0:22:29.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是薇吉妮雅凯利 现场直播新闻台报导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Virginia Kelly from Live Action News.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.03,0:22:32.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.09,0:22:34.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(葛洛佛汽车旅馆 电暖器 有线电视 尚有空房)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.06,0:22:42.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是这间吗?  - 应该是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is this it?  - Oh,3,this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.09,0:22:46.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来还可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.07,0:22:48.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 太棒了  - 这是我们的床 葛斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nice.  - This is our bed,Gus.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.00,0:22:54.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(小马纳德奥迪特)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.05,0:22:58.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来你逃亡了一阵子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seems like you've been running for quite some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.01,0:23:01.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的亡命生涯结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,your running just ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.01,0:23:04.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀人罪没有追溯期限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no statute of limitations for murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.04,0:23:12.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道自己惹到谁了 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea what you've gotten yourself into,do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.00,0:23:16.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我得填写一大堆文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot of paperwork,I suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.00,0:23:25.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国执法官办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}U. S. Marshal's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.05,0:23:28.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是美湖镇的卡特警长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,this is Sheriff Carter in Fairlake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.04,0:23:30.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我抓到一名逃犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a fugitive for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.01,0:23:33.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他逃亡三十年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been on the run for 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.06,0:23:37.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他叫什么名字?  - 马纳德奥迪特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's his name?  - Maynard Odets.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.03,0:23:40.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,案号是316165\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Case number 316165.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.06,0:23:42.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们明天早上十点过去接他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can have transport there by 10 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.08,0:23:44.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,that'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.07,0:23:49.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天一大早 执法官会来接你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The marshals will be here to pick you up in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.06,0:23:52.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你活不了那么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't live that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.09,0:23:56.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不相信你的鬼话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I highly doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.03,0:24:06.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,I... No,I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.07,0:24:10.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 对 但那是个意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,it's... Yeah,but it was a complete accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.09,0:24:12.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是... 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was an a... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.01,0:24:14.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.09,0:24:16.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车子全毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The car is totaled.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.05,0:24:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我派其他警官到游乐园 维持音乐节的秩序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,I sent the other deputies to the fairgrounds to police the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.08,0:24:43.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱尼尔除外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All except Junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.08,0:24:46.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这倒提醒了我 他早该回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which reminds me, he should be back by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.08,0:24:52.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傑森?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jason?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.04,0:24:54.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傑森?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jason?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.02,0:24:56.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布洛汀先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Brodin?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.05,0:25:10.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布洛汀先生... 手机断讯 这样也好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Brodin... Lost the signal. Probably for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.09,0:25:13.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说比利的爸爸气坏了 还算是轻描淡写\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To say Billy's dad is pissed is the understatement of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.06,0:25:17.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 明天他会过来?  - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is he coming tomorrow?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.06,0:25:19.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得比利的麻烦有多大?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much trouble do you think Billy's in?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.07,0:25:22.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 那一包毒品不少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,God,there's a lot of drugs in that bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.03,0:25:25.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想他的罪名不只是行为不检\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think he's gonna get off with a misdemeanor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.01,0:25:27.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得比利会因此去坐牢吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think Billy's gonna go to jail?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.00,0:25:31.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比利的爸爸会帮他找最好的律师 因为他超有钱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billy's dad will throw the best lawyers because Billy's dad is loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.07,0:25:35.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 或许不需要 他可能会走运  - 对 我一点都不担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He might not have to. He might get lucky.  - Yeah. I wouldn't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.09,0:25:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比利的爸爸关系超好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billy's dad's connected up to the Wazoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.00,0:25:41.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我们去参加音乐节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay,so let's go to the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.07,0:25:44.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么? 朱利安 现在我们不能去参加音乐节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell,Julian? We can't go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.07,0:25:48.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待在旅馆房间也帮不了比利 有何不可呢? 我们...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,we can't help Billy sitting in a hotel room. Why not? We...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.05,0:25:50.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 我们大老远跑到这里来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,we came all this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.04,0:25:53.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你提议我们怎么去参加音乐节?  - 走路过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And how do you propose we get there?  - Uh,walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.04,0:25:56.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我哪里都不去 各位 拿去吧 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,I'm not going anywhere,guys. Here,babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.09,0:27:01.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死的小酒鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn drunk kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.03,0:27:13.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.03,0:27:16.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么一回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.00,0:28:06.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦你闭嘴?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.00,0:28:08.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's started.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.00,0:28:12.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们来救我 你死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming for me and you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.05,0:28:14.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是你还不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you don't know it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.01,0:28:15.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁要来救你?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's coming for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.06,0:28:18.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}MY boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.02,0:28:21.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会挖出你的肝脏 在你面前吃掉它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna cut your liver out and eat it in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.02,0:28:25.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想跟这傢伙关在一起 拜托帮我换间牢房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna be in here with this guy. Can you please put me in the other cell?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.07,0:28:28.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.00,0:28:30.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小子 你听到了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear me,kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.04,0:28:32.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你的 老头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you,old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.06,0:28:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以回家了 莫斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can go home,Mose.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.09,0:28:51.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 其他警察在哪里?  - 他们去维持音乐节秩序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are your deputies?  - Covering the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.03,0:28:53.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 或许我该留下来?  - 为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe I should stick around?  - What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.03,0:28:55.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人陪你 以防万一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got nobody with you,just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.06,0:28:58.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的 莫斯 他只是个疯老头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's fine,Mose. He's just a crazy old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.02,0:29:00.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以防万一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.07,0:29:04.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不介意 就那么决定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't mind,that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.00,0:29:06.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 麻烦你帮帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay,but make yourself useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.08,0:29:10.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找一下抽屉里有没有手电筒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go through the drawers for the flashlights.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.08,0:29:12.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灯光救不了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Light ain't gonna save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.05,0:29:16.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不闭嘴 我要以威胁警察罪名起诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't shut up,I'm gonna charge you with threatening an officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.02,0:29:19.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管起诉我吧 警长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,charge away,officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.09,0:29:24.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.01,0:29:30.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.09,0:29:35.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他在这吗?  - 天啊 不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here.  - Oh,my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.04,0:29:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警官好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi,officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.02,0:29:43.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我走错路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I took a wrong turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.05,0:29:45.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能告诉我后台怎么去吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you tell me how to get backstage?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.06,0:29:47.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又走错路了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another wrong turn,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.04,0:29:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以带你过去 但你需要通行证才能进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can show you, but you need a pass to get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.00,0:29:53.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了拿到通行证 我什么都愿意做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will do anything to get a pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.05,0:29:56.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说到底就是你得死翘翘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,there's no use talking to you Dead end,true
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.07,0:29:59.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我所想的 到时她会提醒你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what I'm thinking Oh,she'll remind you
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.00,0:30:05.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到你看到只需要一秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only take a second Till you see I'm just a fake
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.05,0:30:08.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.07,0:30:11.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕格斯警官 请回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deputy Biggs,come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.03,0:30:14.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱尼尔 我是安琪拉 请回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Junior,it's Angela,come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.00,0:30:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦克 凯文 你们听到了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mike,Kevin,you guys out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.03,0:30:32.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我所想 她到时会提醒你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what I'm thinking Oh,she'll remind you
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.05,0:31:06.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来只剩你一个人了 你这个白癡贱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like you're all alone, you dumb bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.08,0:31:15.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四张90块门票 一共是260块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four tickets at 90 bucks a pop, that's 260 bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.05,0:31:17.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm,great.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.01,0:31:24.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只能呆坐在黑夜中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we sit around in the dark all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.04,0:31:26.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真的太好玩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So much fun. So much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.09,0:31:28.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.02,0:31:34.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们知道吗? 我要送食物给比利吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? I'm gonna go and take Billy some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.01,0:31:37.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得拘留所也停电了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think all the power's out in the jail as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.07,0:31:43.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来全镇都停电了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,looks like the whole town's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.04,0:31:46.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 不 当然全镇都停电了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. No,of course not. The whole town's out. The whole town's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.00,0:31:51.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在演唱会上玩得很开心 我们也该那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the concert,having a good time like we should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.09,0:31:54.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿去吧 带着手电筒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here,take this with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.09,0:31:56.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.02,0:32:02.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 待会见  - 再见 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- See you later.  - See you,babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.07,0:32:04.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 再见  - 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- See you.  - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.06,0:32:36.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈啰?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.00,0:33:10.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um,guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.02,0:33:11.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.05,0:33:13.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.08,0:33:16.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 我要去找比利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah?  - I'm gonna go see Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.07,0:33:20.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 酷啊  - 我给你们一些隐私\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cool.  - I'm giving you guys some privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.05,0:33:33.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aah! Unn!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.08,0:33:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万圣节快乐 混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy Halloween,asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.06,0:33:53.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大混蛋!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.06,0:34:28.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ahh...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.00,0:34:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.08,0:35:17.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来这里做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.02,0:35:19.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想来陪比利跟克鲁丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I'd hang out with Billy and Cruz.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.03,0:35:20.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁丝不在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cruz isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.01,0:35:24.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?那太奇怪了 二十分钟前她带食物来找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? That's weird. She left with food about 20 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.06,0:35:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.09,0:35:28.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为她到这里来了 或许她改变了心意 回旅馆了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought she came here. Maybe she changed her mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.05,0:35:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,访客时间结束 明天早上再来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Visiting hours are over. Come in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.08,0:35:33.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样 我不能在这里待一下吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,come on. Can't I just hang out here for a little while?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.03,0:35:38.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 你何不让他留下来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,why don't you let him stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.08,0:35:41.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下子可以多一具屍体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more dead body to add to the pile.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.04,0:35:43.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.09,0:35:46.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个老混蛋一直嚷嚷着要杀了大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This old bastard has been promising to kill everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.08,0:35:48.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说他的孩子们会来救他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says his boys are coming to break him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.00,0:35:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里只有你跟那个酒鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's just you and the drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.07,0:35:54.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 说话小心点 孩子 我酒醒了  - 你最好先离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Watch your mouth,kid. I'm sober now.  - It's probably best if you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.03,0:35:57.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不需要帮手吗? 以防这傢伙是说真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't you want another hand in case this guy's telling the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.06,0:36:01.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以待在这里等你朋友 然后你们一起回汽车旅馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can stay until your friend gets here. Then you can walk back to the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.04,0:36:04.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是怎么了?  - 有些死小孩拿漆弹打我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened to you?  - Fucking kids hit me with a paint balloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.05,0:36:06.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你该跟那女孩回汽车旅馆去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why you should walk back with the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.08,0:36:08.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.01,0:36:12.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.00,0:36:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟我爸谈过了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you talked to my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.02,0:36:20.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我知道 他超级火大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,I know,he's really,really,really extremely,monumentally pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.04,0:36:21.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想像得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,I guess I expected that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.01,0:36:24.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 明天一早他会来帮你办交保\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,he'll be here in the morning to post bail.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.01,0:36:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她有说要用什么罪名起诉你吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did she say what she's charging you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.04,0:36:31.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她没说 但那些毒品足以让我的罪名成立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She didn't say, but there was enough stuff for a felony.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.00,0:36:35.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 我搞砸了 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man,I'm fucked,aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.03,0:36:42.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 他超变态的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,he's creepy as fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.03,0:37:38.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.05,0:37:40.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丽塔...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lita...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.02,0:37:42.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 我一直在想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.07,0:37:45.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.07,0:37:47.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五月时我们就要毕业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We both graduate in May.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.01,0:37:51.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我们可以住在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I was thinking we could move in together.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.00,0:37:57.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛斯 别这样 你知道我要搬到纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gus,come on, you know I'm moving to New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.04,0:37:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经找到工作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got my job lined up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.06,0:38:02.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当会计超无聊的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But accounting is so boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.01,0:38:03.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.01,0:38:07.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝 我们谈过很多次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Babe,we've talked about this a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.04,0:38:08.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我非去不可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.01,0:38:11.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么我跟你一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.02,0:38:15.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.08,0:38:19.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛斯 我喜欢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gus,I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.02,0:38:22.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我甚至爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might even love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.05,0:38:25.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.03,0:38:29.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道 我只是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.07,0:38:32.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要独处一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to spend some time on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.07,0:38:35.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你懂吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.01,0:38:38.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丽塔 我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lita,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.06,0:38:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想失去你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I don't wanna lose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.08,0:38:43.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嫁给我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.02,0:38:44.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.00,0:38:46.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.00,0:38:49.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在西维吉尼亚州的三流汽车旅馆...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're proposing to me in some flea bag motel...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.08,0:38:52.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛斯 跟我求婚? 少来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the middle of West Virginia? Gus,come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.03,0:38:55.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 心意最重要  - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's the thought that counts.  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.05,0:38:57.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Babe...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.01,0:38:59.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.01,0:39:07.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在朱利安回来前把衣服穿好 我得沖个澡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get dressed before Julian comes back. I'm gonna take a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.08,0:39:13.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.07,0:39:34.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我听到了 别猴急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. I heard you. Keep your shirt on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.06,0:39:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the fuck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.07,0:39:42.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你找错房间了 快滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got the wrong hotel room,pal. Move along.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.09,0:39:47.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你醉到连话都说不出来吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you so fucking drunk you don't speak English?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.09,0:39:50.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你滚开 笨蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said,move along,you dumb shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.06,0:39:57.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛斯 是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gus,who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.06,0:40:00.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,音乐节的酒鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some drunk guy from the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.02,0:40:01.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他找错房间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't find his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.09,0:40:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.06,0:40:07.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他的服装蛮酷的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool costume though.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.06,0:40:11.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 笨蛋淋浴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ow. Fuck. Stupid thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.03,0:40:13.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没办法沖澡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stupid shower doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.06,0:40:15.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是冷水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.00,0:40:20.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 王八蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn,you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.06,0:40:26.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我跟你的酒鬼朋友说过 你们找错房间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look,I already told your drunk little buddy you got the wrong room.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.07,0:40:29.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们到底有什么毛病?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it with you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.00,0:40:31.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 你们是智障吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What,are you fucking retarded?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.04,0:40:39.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gus?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.03,0:40:44.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛斯 怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gus,what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.08,0:40:52.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁丝到底在哪里? 她不可能到现在还没到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So where the hell is Cruz? It can't have taken her this long to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.05,0:40:55.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 你要我去找她吗?  - 或许她已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know. You want me to look for her?  - She's probably dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.07,0:40:58.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的孩子们已经在街上把她抓走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My boys already got to her on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.06,0:41:00.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭上你的鸟嘴 老头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut the fuck up,old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.05,0:41:04.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你爱怎么说都可以 大学生...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can say what you like,college boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.04,0:41:08.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你的死期到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but your reckoning is on its way.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.03,0:41:11.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能叫那个死老头闭嘴吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,can you just shut this old bastard up?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.02,0:41:13.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的没办法再听他胡扯下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't stand listening to him any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.04,0:41:15.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能封住他的嘴巴 如果你是那个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,I can't gag him if that's what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.00,0:41:19.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我五分钟时间跟他独处 他会安静一整个晚上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me five minutes with him and he'll be quiet for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.03,0:41:23.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你惹的麻烦够多了 年轻人 别理他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got yourself in enough trouble, young man. Just ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.06,0:41:31.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gus?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.02,0:41:35.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gus?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.00,0:42:32.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.00,0:42:34.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.00,0:42:40.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.00,0:42:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是她来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's probably her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.07,0:43:03.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甜心 怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,sweetheart. How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.03,0:43:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚还蛮有趣的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been an interesting night.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.00,0:43:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我发现停电 於是帮你带了些蜡烛过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I saw the power outage and I thought I'd bring you some candles.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.02,0:43:13.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧?  - 我很好 谢谢你 老公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you okay?  - Yeah,I'm fine. Thanks,honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.07,0:43:16.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 莫斯 你能帮我点蜡烛吗?  - 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mose,can you light some of these for me?  - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.06,0:43:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.00,0:43:23.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我抓到一个逃犯 执法官会来接他...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a fugitive who's being picked up by the marshals...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.03,0:43:25.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...还有犯了毒品罪的小鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and a kid on drug charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.05,0:43:28.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我相信好戏才刚刚上场  - 对 或许是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And I bet your night is just starting.  - Heh. Yeah,probably is.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.06,0:43:30.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你饿了吗?  - 我饿坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You hungry?  - Starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.06,0:43:34.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你不叫你的手下 回来吃三明治?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't call your deputies and come home for a sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.02,0:43:37.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我无法联络上他们 而且我该待在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't reach them and besides,I should really stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.08,0:43:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们哪里都去不了 你得休息一下 你知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those guys aren't going anywhere. Take some time for yourself,you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.09,0:43:44.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警长也有午休时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even the sheriff is entitled to a lunch break.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.05,0:43:46.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 傑森  - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jason.  - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.09,0:43:49.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去做些三明治 待会帮你送过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go fix some sandwiches and I'll be back in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.00,0:43:52.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后晚餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last supper.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.02,0:43:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有什么问题?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's his problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.04,0:43:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那傢伙是谁?  - 别说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who is that guy?  - Don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.06,0:44:01.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 待会见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.07,0:44:03.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待会见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.09,0:44:11.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.04,0:44:13.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来救救我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody help!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.05,0:44:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托! 救命啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.05,0:44:18.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.02,0:44:22.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停车! 拜托 停车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.00,0:44:26.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来救救我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody help!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.04,0:44:29.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来人啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.01,0:44:31.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.04,0:44:34.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.00,0:44:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放了我 你这个该死的疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me go,you crazy fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.07,0:44:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.03,0:44:44.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.05,0:44:46.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.09,0:44:48.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你们 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please,no,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.04,0:45:18.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五毛钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifty cents.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.02,0:45:19.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一块...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buck. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.03,0:45:21.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.03,0:45:27.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.00,0:45:30.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道 我没看过那辆卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I never seen the truck before.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.08,0:45:41.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早跟你说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.07,0:45:44.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的孩子们 他们来救我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my boys. They're here to get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.09,0:45:50.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.00,0:45:57.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 救命啊!  - 是葛斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help!  - That's Gus.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.05,0:46:03.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来人啊 拜托!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody,please!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.06,0:46:05.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.04,0:46:07.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.08,0:46:24.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 我们得把他从路上搬开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,God. We gotta get him out of the middle of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.07,0:46:28.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,I can't. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.07,0:46:31.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来帮帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.09,0:46:48.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警长 死了一个人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One down,huh,sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.05,0:46:51.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你哪里都去不了 你得为此付出代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not going anywhere and you're gonna pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.03,0:46:54.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋 你听到了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear me,you bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.07,0:46:56.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.03,0:47:02.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.06,0:47:04.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我得去找克鲁丝  - 还有丽塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I need to find Cruz.  - And Lita.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.07,0:47:06.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.05,0:47:10.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你们都是警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all deputized.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.03,0:47:14.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你们愿意帮我 我会在法庭上帮你美言几句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you help me,it will go a long way in my report to the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.05,0:47:17.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我得去找我的女朋友  - 不 我们都得待在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But I wanna go after my girlfriend.  - No,we all stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.06,0:47:19.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得等救援赶来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We hold out until help arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.02,0:47:22.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫斯 你负责前门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mose,you watch the front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.06,0:47:25.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个负责窗户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two,cover the windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.06,0:47:30.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们要分散我们 那样子他们比较容易下手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They want us to split up. It makes it easier for them to kill us that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.05,0:47:34.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得待在一起 等待天亮 好了 各就各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we should stick together, here until dawn. Now,get to your stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.03,0:47:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们得打电话求援  - 室内电话不通 手机也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We need to call for help.  - Lines are dead. Cell too.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.09,0:47:42.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警长 李的二手商店后面 有个短波无线电 我看过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh,sheriff,uh,Lee has a short-wave radio in the back of his thrift store. I've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.08,0:47:45.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们需要电力才能使用无线电  - 李有发电机 好点子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We need power to operate it.  - Lee has a generator. Good thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.00,0:47:48.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我要过街到他的店里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen,I'm gonna go across the street to the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.06,0:47:50.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会利用短波无线电求救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna fire up the shortwave and call for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.01,0:47:52.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我陪你去  - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll go with you.  - No,no,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.08,0:47:54.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你待在这里 别让他们进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stay and make sure they don't get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.09,0:47:57.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是个好点子 警长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a bright idea there,sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.01,0:48:01.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 分开来就会死掉 记得吗?  - 他说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Split up and die,remember?  - He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.06,0:48:03.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会拿你们的生命安全冒险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not risk your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.05,0:48:06.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的工作 我在街上时帮我掩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my job. Now,cover me when I'm on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.08,0:48:39.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(二手商店)
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.07,0:48:49.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.01,0:48:52.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 你在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay,where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.02,0:48:54.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay,come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.06,0:48:58.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you? Where are you? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.08,0:49:01.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.05,0:49:09.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(欢迎光临李叔二手商店)
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.09,0:49:22.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.06,0:49:25.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.04,0:49:32.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.00,0:49:34.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汽油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.04,0:49:35.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汽油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.09,0:49:39.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.08,0:49:46.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.09,0:50:07.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们该去帮她  - 不 我答应过我会待在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We should go help her.  - Nope. I gave my word I'd stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.05,0:50:09.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我去帮她  - 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll go.  - Give it a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.06,0:50:12.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 如果再听到枪声 我们就去帮她  - 但我们没有...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just... If we hear another shot,we'll go.  - But we don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.05,0:50:14.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不认识这个女人 她不是克鲁丝或丽塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't know this woman. She's not Cruz or Lita.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.09,0:50:18.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们该去找她们 等一下  - 那我们就去找女孩们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We should be going after them. Just wait.  - Let's go find the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.04,0:50:22.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一离开 他们会起诉你 等一下 看看她会不会回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you leave,they'll throw the book at you. Wait a few minutes,see if she comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.02,0:50:25.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她回来后 再跟她说我们要离开  - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- If she does,we'll tell her we're both going.  - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.08,0:50:27.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.04,0:51:04.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是美湖镇卡特警长 通报紧急事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Sheriff Carter of Fairlake declaring emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.02,0:51:06.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人听到吗? 完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is anyone out there? Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.05,0:51:14.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西维吉尼亚州美湖镇卡特警长 通报紧急事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sheriff Carter of Fair/ake,West Virginia declaring an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.07,0:51:17.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人听到吗? 完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can anyone hear me? Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.04,0:51:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听到了 警长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yup,I hear you,sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.07,0:51:22.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字? 你在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your name and where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.08,0:51:26.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泰迪塔伯特 我在新罕布夏州迪克斯维尔山口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh,Teddy Tabet. I'm in Dixville Notch,New Hampshire.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.05,0:51:29.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 仔细听我说 泰迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay,listen to me carefully,Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.04,0:51:32.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你打电话给 在芒兹维尔的维吉尼亚州警\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to call the Virginia State Police in Moundsville.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.09,0:51:36.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请他们立刻调派所有人力到美湖镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have them send every available officer to Fairlake right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.07,0:51:38.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是紧急状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.07,0:51:40.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.03,0:51:43.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三个山地人围攻本镇 他们想要闯入警局...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The town is under siege by three hillbillies. They're trying to break...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.08,0:51:47.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,营救被关在拘留所的亲人 他们已经杀了一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one of their relatives out of jail. They've already killed one person already.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.06,0:51:51.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说西维吉尼亚州美湖镇吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you say Fairlake,West Virginia?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.06,0:51:53.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 我们的电话不通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,that's right. And we have no phone service.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.00,0:51:57.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你立刻打电话给州警 你能那么做吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I need you to call the state police right away. Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.03,0:51:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay,okay. One minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.02,0:52:10.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你嗑了药吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you stoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.02,0:52:12.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.02,0:52:15.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是嗑了药或在耍我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you stoned or do you just think I'm stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.01,0:52:19.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在胡说什么?泰迪 我需要你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about,Teddy? I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.02,0:52:21.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚是山地人节吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight's the Mountain Man Festival, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.05,0:52:24.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得那很好玩 你能整翻州警...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think it would be funny to scramble the entire state police...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.07,0:52:26.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你能说服某个呆瓜 帮你打电话?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you convinced some dork to call?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.09,0:52:28.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.02,0:52:30.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是警长 我需要你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the sheriff and I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.06,0:52:31.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事态严重 泰迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is serious,Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.09,0:52:35.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 乱打电话报警是犯法的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,listen,it's a felony to file a fake police report,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.04,0:52:38.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是笨蛋 迪克斯维尔山口的人水准很高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not stupid. We here in Dixville Notch are a pretty savvy bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.09,0:52:40.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是骗不了我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't pull the wool over my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.09,0:52:43.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 晚安 警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,uh,yeah,heh, have a good night,officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.04,0:52:46.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 拜托 听我说 泰迪 你得相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait,wait,wait. Please,listen,Teddy, you gotta believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.05,0:52:48.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这件事攸关生死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a matter of life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.07,0:52:57.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 该死  - 那是什么声音?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shit.  - What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.05,0:52:58.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人快死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.00,0:53:02.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你相信我了吗?混蛋 快报警\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You believe me now,asshole? Just call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.01,0:53:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我想我打中一个了  - 该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think I got one of them.  - Shit,shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.06,0:53:18.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大白癡 如果是警长呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You idiot. What if that was the sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.06,0:53:29.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你受伤了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.05,0:53:33.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 那是葛斯吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,my God. Is that Gus?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.02,0:53:34.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是葛斯吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that Gus?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.04,0:53:36.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.05,0:53:39.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.02,0:53:45.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 你没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right,okay. You're all right. You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.03,0:53:51.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱利安 让我进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Julian,let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.08,0:53:56.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 发生了什么事?  - 这个酒鬼差点杀死我朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened?  - This drunk nearly killed my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.05,0:53:57.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.00,0:54:00.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他不该拿枪的  - 那是个意外!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He has no business carrying a gun.  - It was an accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.08,0:54:03.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我该痛扁你一顿  - 冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I should beat this shit out of you! Hey,calm down.  - Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.09,0:54:06.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你冷静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said,calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.07,0:54:11.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有受伤吗?  - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Were you hit?  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.04,0:54:12.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 你看到克鲁丝了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Have you seen Cruz?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.00,0:54:14.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟她在一起吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.02,0:54:17.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她比我先出门 朱利安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She left before Julian.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.05,0:54:19.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她死了 白马王子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's dead,lover boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.02,0:54:24.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许她被吞进胜子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably being digested right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.07,0:54:27.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的孩子们喜欢吃人肉...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My boys have a taste for flesh...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.09,0:54:30.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特别是金发小美女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}especially cute little blonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.09,0:54:33.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you shut the fuck up?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.06,0:54:37.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果她真的出事 我会杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If anything happened to her, I'm gonna fucking kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.06,0:54:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放了我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me go...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.06,0:54:53.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许其他人能活着看到天亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and maybe the rest of them will live to see the dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.07,0:54:55.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not getting out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.04,0:54:58.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们只有四个人 再加上她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's four of you and one of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.05,0:55:00.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想一下你们到底要不要活命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think how much you wanna live.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.07,0:55:04.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你觉得我们会放了你 你一定是疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're out of your mind if you think any one of us is gonna let you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.09,0:55:06.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suit yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.09,0:55:12.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用短波无线电 联络上任何人了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you reach anybody on the short wave?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.02,0:55:14.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有  - 太棒了 那代表救援很快会赶到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes.  - Great. That means help is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.05,0:55:16.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不知道  - 你是什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know.  - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.02,0:55:19.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想收到讯息的笨蛋不相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dumb shit on the other line, I don't think he believed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.09,0:55:22.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我要去找克鲁丝  - 我说过不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm going to look for Cruz.  - Hey,I told you,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.06,0:55:25.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那么你得把我关起来  - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well,then you better lock me back up.  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.01,0:55:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 或许我搞砸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right,I may be a fuck up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.07,0:55:32.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不负责任 不可靠 非常幼稚 但我非常忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm irresponsible,I'm unreliable and I'm definitely juvenile,but I am loyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.03,0:55:35.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱克鲁丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love Cruz.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.07,0:55:38.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是我一生的最爱...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love her more than anything I've ever loved in my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.07,0:55:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...我不会待在这里 放她一个人在外面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I'm not gonna sit in here while she's out there on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.09,0:55:44.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我无法允许自己那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't live with myself if I did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.04,0:55:48.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要不把我关起来 要不就放了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So either lock me up or let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.04,0:55:53.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 拿去吧 你会需要这个  - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here,you're gonna need this.  - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.01,0:55:58.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我跟你一起去  - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm going with you.  - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.06,0:56:02.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gonna be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.00,0:56:04.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.02,0:56:06.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We Will.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.05,0:56:18.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得四处看一下 试着寻找她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll look around here, see if we can find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.06,0:56:21.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 眼睛睁大一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Keep your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.04,0:56:29.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cruz.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.01,0:56:32.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁丝 我是比利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cruz,it's Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.08,0:56:34.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.09,0:56:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果克鲁丝发现不对劲 她会躲起来 不肯出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Cruz knows what's up, she'll be hiding and won't come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.01,0:56:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.08,0:56:46.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望真的是那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope that's the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.03,0:57:02.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 先生?  - 叫我莫斯就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mister?  - Call me Mose.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.00,0:57:07.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么他们要这么做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are they doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.05,0:57:10.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想他们是来救他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They wanna break him out,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.06,0:57:13.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他们屠杀无辜的人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But killing innocent people?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.05,0:57:16.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要杀死葛斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why kill Gus?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.07,0:57:19.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个老头被关起来的事跟他无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had nothing to do with keeping that old guy locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.00,0:57:23.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想杀人对这些傢伙来说 是稀松平常的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get the feeling that killing ain't too much of a stretch for this bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.00,0:57:29.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果没有人来救我们呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if no help comes?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.03,0:57:32.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定会有人来救我们 别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.00,0:57:37.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比利跟朱利安呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Billy and Julian?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.08,0:57:39.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会找到你的朋友...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll find your friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.07,0:57:41.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起回到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then they'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.02,0:57:49.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁丝!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cruz!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.03,0:57:52.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.00,0:57:56.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她到底会在哪里?  - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where the hell could she be?  - I don't know,man.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.03,0:58:00.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.05,0:58:02.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么声音?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.05,0:58:05.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 比利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move,Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.03,0:58:11.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit. Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.06,0:58:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得离开街道 在这里我们只能坐以待毙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta get out of the street. We're sitting ducks.
