Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.06,0:58:37.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 克鲁丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,shit. Cruz.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.08,0:58:39.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,my God,baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.08,0:58:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.00,0:58:42.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.05,0:58:43.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cruz.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.09,0:58:46.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是哪门子的禽兽?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of fucking animals are they?
