Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.02,1:00:34.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.05,1:00:35.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.01,1:00:37.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
