Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.02,1:00:52.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.03,1:00:57.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,my,God. Oh,my,God.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.03,1:01:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.02,1:01:05.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.09,1:01:09.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我们!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help us!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.04,1:01:11.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来人啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody!
