Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.07,1:01:41.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱利安 不要丢下我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Julian,don't leave me. Don't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.05,1:01:42.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.00,1:01:45.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不! 不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No! No!
