Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.09,1:03:16.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能整晚待在这里 等他们回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't sit here all night and wait for them to come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.08,1:03:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们得派人去求救  - 对 那个人就是你 莫斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Somebody needs to go for help.  - Yes,and that has to be you,Mose.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.04,1:03:23.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你办得到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you do it?
