Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.09,1:03:44.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我可以的  - 开我的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can do it,sheriff.  - Take my truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.05,1:03:46.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到游乐园找朱尼尔...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it to the fairgrounds and find Junior...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.08,1:03:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有其他警察 要他们回警局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the other deputies and bring them back here.
