Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.05,1:03:58.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会消失在夜色里 你会很安全的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}disappear into the night. You'll be safe.
