Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.05,1:04:04.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好想一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.02,1:04:07.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是大学生 动脑筋想一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a college kid. Use your head.
