Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.01,1:04:22.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.07,1:04:24.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以相信我 安琪拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can count on me,Angela.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.09,1:04:28.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前没有人相信我可以办好事情...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know not too many people have counted on me in the past to do anything right...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.08,1:04:33.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚我要重新开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I'm turning over a new leaf, starting tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.03,1:04:36.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会带救兵回来 我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will be back with help. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.05,1:04:39.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你何不答应他们的要求? 把那个老头交给他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you just give them what they want? Give them the old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.08,1:04:43.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 救兵到了后再去抓他们  - 不 我要伸张正义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can track them when you have help.  - No. I want justice.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.09,1:04:45.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伸张正义?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Justice?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.03,1:04:48.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我男朋友的正义又在哪里? 他的屍体就躺在门前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about justice for my boyfriend whose body is lying on your porch?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.07,1:04:50.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛斯的正义又在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about justice for Gus,huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.04,1:04:51.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还不懂吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.07,1:04:56.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我放了他 你永远无法为你男朋友伸张正义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I let him go,you may never get justice for your boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.02,1:05:00.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我很遗憾你遇上这种事 但你无法改变我的心意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look,I'm sorry about what happened to you,but you're not changing my mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.02,1:05:03.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.02,1:05:05.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们上吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.07,1:05:09.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我车上有无线电 随时保持联络 小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a radio in my truck. Keep in constant contact and be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.00,1:05:13.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的车停在回收场旁边的加油站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My truck is at the gas station by the junkyard.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.04,1:05:15.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会掩护你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll cover you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.00,1:05:32.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go. Go,go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.03,1:05:37.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(警长)
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.00,1:05:41.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 快点 拜托快发动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God,come on,come on,come on. Please,please,please start.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.06,1:05:57.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.03,1:06:02.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫斯 你听到了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mose,can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.05,1:06:05.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听到了 警长 我正要飞奔赶过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you,sheriff. I'm on my way like a bat out of hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.01,1:06:07.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你安全抵达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you there in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.00,1:06:09.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别开太快 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not too fast,okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.07,1:06:10.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.00,1:06:14.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(速限55英里)
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.05,1:06:16.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚上公路 警长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just getting on the highway now,sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.00,1:06:18.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没看到他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sign of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.08,1:06:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 保持联络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good,keep me posted.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.06,1:06:22.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过我不会让你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you,I wouldn't let you...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.01,1:06:24.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.01,1:06:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mose?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.00,1:06:38.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mose?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.04,1:06:44.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫斯? 请回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mose? Come in,Mose.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.02,1:06:45.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mose?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.02,1:08:08.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比利跟朱利安早该回来了 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billy and Julian should have been back by now,shouldn't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.00,1:08:10.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.03,1:08:13.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们死了 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're dead,aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.06,1:08:15.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们并不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.07,1:08:18.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要死在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna die here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.03,1:08:21.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.08,1:08:23.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.06,1:08:24.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们无处可去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no place to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.09,1:08:26.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里一定有车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There must be a car or a truck or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.01,1:08:30.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 莫斯开走我唯一的车  - 我可以偷辆车 什么都可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mose took my only truck. - Well, then I'll steal a car. Anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.04,1:08:32.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just need to get the fuck out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.06,1:08:34.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会接电线启动引擎吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how to hot-wire a car?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.09,1:08:36.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.04,1:08:40.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 音乐节就要结束 我的手下都会回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look,the festival will be over soon. My deputies will be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.03,1:08:43.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只要再等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just have to wait a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.07,1:08:47.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 如果我等不了那么久呢?  - 你没有选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And what if I can't wait that long?  - You really don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.01,1:08:50.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个人跑到外面简直是自杀行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To go out there now by yourself would be suicide.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.07,1:08:52.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非你跟我一起走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if you come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.08,1:08:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't leave here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.07,1:08:56.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在只剩下我们两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's two of us left.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.09,1:09:00.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他们真的来救他 我们该怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can we possibly do if they come for him?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.03,1:09:01.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得尽力而为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our best.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.06,1:09:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你比他更疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you're crazier than he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.05,1:09:15.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警长 救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sheriff. Help me,sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.00,1:09:18.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警长!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sheriff!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.02,1:09:26.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警长 救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sheriff. Sheriff. Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.04,1:09:31.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 拜托 别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,no. Please. Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.01,1:09:34.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.04,1:10:19.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以突袭她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can surprise her.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.03,1:10:23.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抢走她的武器 逼她放了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take her weapon and force her to let me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.03,1:10:27.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我办不到  - 她只是一个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't.  - She's just a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.06,1:10:28.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别烦我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.00,1:10:30.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你活下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna see you live.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.00,1:10:33.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很聪明 丽塔 你太聪明了 不该死掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're smart,Lita. Too smart to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.01,1:10:35.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你别烦我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said,leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.00,1:10:38.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你比你的朋友都聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're smarter than your friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.03,1:10:40.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 你曾逃出我孩子的魔掌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell,you even got away from my boys once.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.07,1:10:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有资格活下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You deserve to live.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.09,1:10:47.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会要我的孩子们放你一马...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will tell my boys to let you live...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.09,1:10:51.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你愿意帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.03,1:10:52.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.00,1:10:55.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.00,1:11:00.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你站在那里 什么都不做 你跟那个臭女人死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you and that bitch are certainly gonna die if you just stand there and do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.00,1:11:04.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以跟你保证那一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I can guarantee you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.04,1:11:09.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.05,1:11:11.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.02,1:11:12.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.07,1:11:14.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.04,1:11:16.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.08,1:11:18.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.08,1:11:23.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.01,1:11:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.07,1:11:45.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是莫斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Mose.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.03,1:11:46.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个声音是从哪来传来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,where's it coming from?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.00,1:11:52.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(易燃气体)
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.05,1:12:10.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在二手商店里 来吧 拿着这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in the thrift store. Here,take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.04,1:12:13.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着他 有人敢闯进来 格杀勿论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch him. If anyone comes in,shoot them.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.01,1:12:15.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么...? 你打算怎么办?  - 我只能尽力而为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wha... What are you gonna do?  - What I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.07,1:12:18.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,God.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.07,1:12:34.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的机会来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now's your chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.09,1:12:39.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.01,1:12:41.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别傻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.02,1:12:42.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.01,1:12:46.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把眼光放远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have some vision.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.02,1:12:47.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.09,1:12:49.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想活下去 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you wanna live,don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.09,1:12:53.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.07,1:12:55.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就把门打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,then open this cell.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.08,1:12:59.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会离开 我的孩子们也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will go away and so will my boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.08,1:13:01.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考虑一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.05,1:13:05.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我怎么能相信你呢?  - 你有枪 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How can I trust you?  - Well,you have the gun,don't you?
