Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.02,1:21:50.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Heh,heh.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.03,1:21:53.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要拼到最后一刻吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fighter to the end,huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.08,1:21:57.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很佩服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admirable.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.07,1:21:59.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.00,1:22:05.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个好心人 我跟你解释一下我要怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as I am a man of mercy,let me explain to you what is happening here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.03,1:22:10.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会用胶带将霰弹枪黏在你嘴巴上...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am gonna duct tape this shotgun to your mouth...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.03,1:22:12.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将电线绑在板机上...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I have attached a wire to the trigger...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.01,1:22:14.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另一端绑在你脚上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is also attached to your foot.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.01,1:22:19.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你将脚跟放下...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that when you come down off your tippy-toes...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.06,1:22:22.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电线会拉动板机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the wire is gonna pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.07,1:22:26.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基本上我是提供你一条捷径 警长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Essentially,I am offering you a way out, sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.05,1:22:28.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,换作是我 我会答应的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I were you,I would take it...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.02,1:22:33.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为被烧死真的很痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because burning to death is one painful way to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.03,1:22:34.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个大混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.04,1:23:03.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒数计时了 警长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tick tock,sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.06,1:23:04.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.03,1:23:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 那样应该没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There,that ought to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.04,1:23:22.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你只要...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,all you have to do...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.08,1:23:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.09,1:23:29.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将脚跟放下:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heels to the floor and:
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.05,1:23:31.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boom.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.06,1:23:33.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.04,1:23:38.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不必谢我 警长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,you don't need to thank me,sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.02,1:23:46.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还撑着吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hang on in there,huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.00,1:24:50.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 该离开这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right,let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.06,1:25:18.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.01,1:25:22.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停车 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.08,1:25:24.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.02,1:25:26.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.05,1:25:29.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.09,1:25:32.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.02,1:25:35.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.04,1:25:37.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.02,1:25:40.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,please.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.00,1:25:45.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 你停车了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,thank God you stopped.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.06,1:25:47.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们杀了我朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They killed my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.09,1:25:51.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得报警 他们要杀了警长 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to call the police before they kill the sheriff,please.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.07,1:25:53.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.08,1:26:01.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,thank God.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.02,1:26:03.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.03,1:26:06.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎你回来 丽塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome home,Lita.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.04,1:26:09.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.05,1:26:13.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha-ha-ha! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.05,1:26:21.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.04,1:26:29.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
